Tue Sep 22 17:42:23 UTC 2026 - Atri Bhattacharya <badshah400@gmail.com>

- Update to version 3.4.0:
  * fix: faulty undef (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#509).
  * fix: hide installation behind an option
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#512).
  * fix compilation with newer gtest (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#514).
  * cmake: Set cmake_minimum_required policy_max
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#519).
  * Update SQLite from 3.49.2 to 3.51.1 (2025-11-28)
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#526).
  * Add AI coding guidelines for GitHub Copilot and Cursor
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#529).
  * Update SQLite from 3.51.1 to 3.51.3 (2026-03-13)
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#538).
  * Add a set of granular SKILLs extracted from the monolithic
    copilot instructions (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#531).
  * Generalized cmake sqlite & key api to allow easier use of
    SQLite Multiple Ciphers (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#532).
  * Add agent skills for releases, SQLite updates, CHANGELOG, and
    authoring (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#546).
  * Update bundled SQLite from 3.51.3 to 3.53.2
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#548).
  * Enforce LF line endings via .gitattributes and normalize
    existing files (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#550).
  * Add CI workflow code coverage (GCov + Coveralls)
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#549).
  * Improve unit test coverage of error and edge-case paths
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#551).
  * Fix unreliable 16-byte header check in
    Database::isUnencrypted() (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#553).
  * Guard null C pointers in Exception, Database, and Statement
    against UB (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#552).
  * Fix Column::operator<< to stream the exact column bytes
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#556).
  * Fix stale bindings leaking between execute_many() parameter
    sets (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#554).
  * Restore Coverity Scan static analysis as a GitHub Actions
    workflow (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#557).
  * Fix Database::getHeaderInfo() signed-shift UB and use
    fixed-width Header types (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#558).
  * Fix Savepoint destructor exception-safety and rollback
    bookkeeping (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#559).
  * Fix broken Meson build when SQLITECPP_DISABLE_STD_FILESYSTEM
    is set (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#560).
  * Range for loop for statements (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#545).
  * Update SQLite from 3.53.2 to 3.53.3 (2026-06-26)
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#561).
  * Fix coverage regression for Statement::RowIterator
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#562).
  * Fix large std::string binding sizes
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#563).
  * Add 64-bit BLOB binding methods (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#564).
  * Update bundled SQLite to 3.53.4 (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#566).
  * Fix GCov linking for shared libraries
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#567).
  * Add sanitizer and cppcheck quality gates
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#568).
  * Add CodeQL security analysis (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#569).
  * Fix gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#533: accept binary database keys
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#571).
  * Add mixed C++ standard consumer tests
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#574).
  * Restore SQLite::Header ABI compatibility
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#575).
  * Restore SQLite::Savepoint ABI compatibility
    (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#576).
  * Update copyright years to 2026 (gh#SRombauts/SQLiteCpp#578).
- Rebase 0001-Generate-pkgconfig-file-also-from-CMake-build.patch
  for update.
- Rebase 0001-Fix-required-C-version-for-CMake-builds.patch for
  update.

